# duranta-project/openairinterface5g — PR labels
# https://github.com/duranta-project/openairinterface5g/labels
#
# At least one CI label is required when opening a PR (see doc/code-style-contrib.md).
# Failure to add a label prevents CI from running.

# --- Selected for NWS PR (frequency-domain network slicing) ---
5G-NR
gNB

# --- All repository labels ---
# name			description
4G-LTE			Perform 4G Tests
5G-NR			Perform 5G Tests
BUILD-ONLY		Execute build stages only for code improvements with no impact on 4G/5G functionality.
CI			Perform both 4G and 5G tests
documentation		Documentation-related changes or updates.
gNB
L1
nrUE			Run only 5G UE tests (physims included, LDPC tests excluded).
bug			Something is not working as expected
help wanted		Extra attention is needed
imported-from-gitlab	Items migrated from GitLab into this repository.
retrigger-ci		Re-run CI
security		Security related issues or fixes.

# --- NWS PR notes ---
# Use:     5G-NR + gNB
# Avoid:   nrUE (no UE changes), L1 (MAC only), BUILD-ONLY (skips 5G runtime tests),
#           documentation alone (skips 5G tests), 4G-LTE (NR-only change)
